From: serlk <22211586+Serlk@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:23:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] arm64: dts: mediatek: mt6878-titan2: Add the three
 cameras

mt6878-unihertz-titan2-cameras.dtsi, included by -all: the IMX766 main,
S5KGD1SP front and Hi-847 second rear cameras with their VCMs, GPIO
switched supplies, 24 MHz MCLKs, the camera vcore domain supply (MT6319
VMM buck), the seninf CSI ports and one CAMSV engine per sensor behind the
SMI larbs and the MM IOMMU; each engine is its own media device. The
S5KGD1SP needs its sensor firmware patch, which is not distributed.

-all-iommu: a test board, -all plus the display behind the same IOMMU,
which -all leaves out for now (with the camera ports on the same M4U the
screen showed the boot loader picture). Examples (not built) for a
single-sensor fragment, the media graph and the CAMSV IOMMU path.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
