@@ -17,6 +17,10 @@
  * init values and bus selection while the display is running, as with
  * the -iommu DTB.
  *
+ * With the cameras (titan2-camera) -all has the M4U, and larb7 enabled
+ * here is bound to it too; without iommus on the encoder its ports keep
+ * MMU_EN clear and the physical addressing above still applies.
+ *
  * If the encoder times out or the bus hangs, boot the -all DTB again.
